    {"id":"S-PUSH","name":"Push 待打开","surface_id":"SURF-PUSH","type":"entry","entry":"用满有效触达后，C 端生成 Push","visible":"标题“您的课程时间有重叠”，说明可查看并调整上课安排","actions":[{"id":"A-OPEN-PUSH","label":"打开 Push"},{"id":"A-DISMISS-PUSH","label":"关闭 Push"}],"terminal":false,"source_anchor":"S2；S3 Push；S6","visual_ref":"VIS-FULL#push"},
    {"id":"S-MESSAGE","name":"站内消息待打开","surface_id":"SURF-MESSAGE","type":"entry","entry":"用满有效触达后，C 端同时生成并保留站内消息","visible":"课程时间调整提醒、两门冲突课程和“查看调整方案”按钮","actions":[{"id":"A-OPEN-MESSAGE","label":"查看调整方案"}],"terminal":false,"source_anchor":"S2；S3 站内消息；S6","visual_ref":"VIS-FULL#message"},
    {"id":"S-PUSH-CLOSED","name":"Push 已关闭","surface_id":"SURF-EXTERNAL","type":"completed","entry":"用户关闭 Push","visible":"Push 结束展示；站内消息仍保留，可作为独立入口再次进入","actions":[],"terminal":true,"source_anchor":"S3 站内消息","visual_ref":"VIS-FULL#push-closed"},
    {"id":"S-CHECKING","name":"重新校验中","surface_id":"SURF-CHECK","type":"loading","entry":"用户点击 Push 或站内消息","visible":"进入方案前重新校验当前资格与方案，不使用消息生成时的历史结果","actions":[],"terminal":false,"source_anchor":"S2；S4","visual_ref":"VIS-FULL#checking"},
